# Logs — root-anchored: an unanchored "logs/" here previously matched
# src/routes/logs/ too, which `railway up`'s local-upload path filters by
# (unlike a normal git-push deploy, which checks out the tracked tree and
# ignores .gitignore entirely) — silently dropped the whole route directory
# from the build. Caught via a failed CLI deploy, Sep 2026.
/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

